---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Knight Capital deployment (SEC 34-70694 paras 13-16, 27). Eight SMARS servers; the new code reached seven.
// Row 2 is what the attempted rollback did (para 27): the code was removed from the seven good servers.
const W = 900;
const H = 380;
const xs = Array.from({ length: 8 }, (_, i) => 40 + i * 104);
---
<figure class="atp13-es">
  <div class="atp13-es-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Eight order-router servers. After the deployment seven run the new code and one still runs the old Power Peg code. After the rollback attempt all eight run the old code.">
      <text x="40" y="28" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>After the deployment (27 July to 1 August)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Sau lần triển khai (27/7 đến 1/8)</tspan>
      </text>
      {xs.map((x, i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={x} y="44" width="90" height="84" rx="8" class={i === 7 ? 'box hot fm-glow' : 'box good'} />
          <DiagramIcon name="server" x={x + 45} y={72} size={24} />
          <text x={x + 45} y="108" text-anchor="middle" class="lab">{i === 7 ? '8' : String(i + 1)}</text>
          <text x={x + 45} y="122" text-anchor="middle" class={i === 7 ? 'sub hotl' : 'sub'}>
            <tspan data-lang-en>{i === 7 ? 'old code' : 'new code'}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{i === 7 ? 'code cũ' : 'code mới'}</tspan>
          </text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <text x="40" y="154" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>One technician did not copy the new code to server 8. No second person checked, and no written procedure asked for one.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Một kỹ thuật viên không chép code mới sang server 8. Không ai kiểm tra lại, và không có quy trình bằng văn bản yêu cầu việc đó.</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="40" y="204" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>After the attempt to roll back</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Sau khi cố rollback</tspan>
      </text>
      {xs.map((x) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={x} y="220" width="90" height="84" rx="8" class="box hot" />
          <DiagramIcon name="server" x={x + 45} y={248} size={24} />
          <text x={x + 45} y="298" text-anchor="middle" class="sub hotl">
            <tspan data-lang-en>old code</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>code cũ</tspan>
          </text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <text x="40" y="330" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Knight removed the new code from the seven good servers. Their old Power Peg code then ran too, which made the problem worse.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Knight gỡ code mới khỏi bảy server đang đúng. Code Power Peg cũ trên đó cũng chạy theo, và sự cố nặng hơn.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="40" y="356" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>The old code was dead for years, and a 2005 change to it was never retested.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Code cũ bị bỏ không dùng nhiều năm, và thay đổi năm 2005 trên nó chưa bao giờ được test lại.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Source: SEC order, Release 34-70694, paragraphs 13 to 16 and 27.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Nguồn: lệnh xử phạt của SEC, Release 34-70694, đoạn 13 đến 16 và 27.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp13-es { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp13-es-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp13-es svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .atp13-es .h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp13-es .lab { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp13-es .sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp13-es .hotl { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp13-es .note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp13-es .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp13-es .box.good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .atp13-es .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .atp13-es figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
